Tunnet uses a component-level licensing model.

The authoritative licensing policy and path-by-path license map are in
LICENSING.md.

Unmodified standard license texts are stored in LICENSES/:

- LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt
- LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt
- LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

Third-party files remain governed by their own licenses, even when they are
located inside a Tunnet component. File-level SPDX information, companion
`.license` files, and `.reuse/dep5` take precedence over the default path map.

Commercial alternatives are available for the AGPL-3.0-only components and,
when expressly identified in an Order Form, for closed modifications to
MPL-2.0 components.
